ork schedules in order to accommodate weekends, evenings, and holiday shifts.&nbsp; Overtime work may also occur.&nbsp; Employees may experience hazardous or dangerous situations in the course of their work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Position ...<a href=\"http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=200185\"> more...</a> Memphis, TN Tue, 05 May 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=200185 Graduate Assistant Events Management - Christian Brothers University http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204348 Staff Administrative and Professional Part-time Non-Exempt <b> Location: </b> Memphis, TN <B> Category: </B> Staff <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time Non-Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Sep 1 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Provide overall leadership and direction in all Events Scheduling and Technical matters. Manage on campus events, including setting up chairs and tables for layout requests. Set up and install media equipment such as LCD projectors, speakers, TVs, video monitors, and cameras. Set up and run the sound and video equipment used to conduct live events such as meetings and on campus events. Manage online event requests, event schedules and calendars. Research, evaluate, and recommend new ideas and vendors to support evolving event needs. Support relationships with vendors, from production to ...<a href=\"http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204348\"> more...</a> Memphis, TN Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204348 Head Women's Flag Football Coach - Christian Brothers University http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203339 Staff Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Memphis, TN <B> Category: </B> Staff <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 4 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Christian Brothers University seeks an innovative and enthusiastic Head Women's Flag Football Coach to launch and lead the University's intercollegiate flag football program. The Head Coach will be responsible for creating a sustainable, competitive program that attracts talented student-athletes while supporting the University's mission of academic excellence, leadership, and service.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The successful candidate will serve as an ambassador for the sport and the University by cultivating relationships with prospective students, high school coaches, community organizations, and alu...<a href=\"http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203339\"> more...</a> Memphis, TN Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203339 Head Wrestling Coach - Christian Brothers University http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203488 Staff Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Memphis, TN <B> Category: </B> Staff <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Fri Aug 7 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Christian Brothers University invites applications for the position of Head Wrestling Coach. This individual will provide leadership for all aspects of the Universities wrestling program, including program development, recruitment and retention of qualified student-athletes, coaching,scheduling, fiscal management, fundraising, and NCAA compliance. The Head Coach will create a culture that supports academic success, competitive excellence, sportsmanship, and the mission and values of Christian Brothers University.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Coaching and Program Development</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul><li>...<a href=\"http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203488\"> more...</a> Memphis, TN Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203488 Maintenance Tech II - Christian Brothers University http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201090 Staff Physical Plant Administrative and Professional Full-time Non-Exempt <b> Location: </b> Memphsi, TN <B> Category: </B> Staff <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time Non-Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Jun 2 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Job Purpose:<br>\r\nAt CBU, the Maintenance Tech II plays a vital role in ensuring the smooth operation and upkeep of a multi-building campus environment. Each technician brings a unique set of skills and expertise, contributing to a collaborative and responsive team dynamic. The campus layout, consisting of multiple academic, residential, and administrative buildings. This requires a coordinated approach to maintenance tasks ranging from HVAC and electrical systems to plumbing, carpentry, and general repairs.<br>\r\nMaintenance Technicians are not assigned to a single building but instead w...<a href=\"http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=201090\"> more...</a> Memphsi, TN Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=201090 Part-Time Campus Safety Officer - Christian Brothers University http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=197317 Staff Campus Police and Safety Administrative and Professional Part-time <b> Location: </b> Memphis, TN <B> Category: </B> Staff <B> Job Type: </B> Part-time <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Feb 16 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p><strong><u>Position Summary:</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Responsible for monitoring all vehicle and pedestrian traffic entering or leaving the campus. Ensures the safety and security of all personnel, students, guests, and facilities on campus. The entrance attendant is responsible for greeting people on the telephone and in person.&nbsp;Employees in this position may require holiday, weekend, evening, or overnight work. May be required to work special details or additional hours as needed.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><u><strong>&nbsp;Duties and Responsibil...<a href=\"http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=197317\"> more...</a> Memphis, TN Mon, 16 Feb 2026 00:00:00 -0500 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=197317 Stunt Head Coach - Christian Brothers University http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203876 Staff Administrative and Professional Full-time <b> Location: </b> Memphis, TN <B> Category: </B> Staff <B> Job Type: </B> Full-time <B> Posted On: </B> Tue Aug 18 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Christian Brothers, a Lasallian liberal arts college, is seeking a Head Coach for STUNT and Cheerleading. This position is charged with oversight of the STUNT and Cheerleading programs and fulfilling the duties and responsibilities of the head coach. The coach is expected to follow all NCAA, STUNT, Conference, and College policies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Responsible for the overall function of the STUNT and cheerleading programs within conference and NCAA regulations. Instruct and work with student athletes to prepare them for competition. Help athletes to enhance athletic performance individually or...<a href=\"http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203876\"> more...</a> Memphis, TN Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=203876 Vice President, Administration & Finance / Chief Financial Officer - Christian Brothers University http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=203306 Staff Administrative and Professional Exempt <b> Location: </b> Memphis, TN <B> Category: </B> Staff <B> Job Type: </B> Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Mon Aug 3 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p>Mission of the Role</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Applicants are encouraged to review the Vice President, Administration & Finance / Chief Financial Officer Prospectus linked here.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/christian-brothers-university/images/v1786109773/cbu-website-assets/Exec-Search-Profile-VP-Admin-Finance-Chief-Financial-Officer-Christian-Brothers-University-2026/Exec-Search-Profile-VP-Admin-Finance-Chief-Financial-Officer-Christian-Brothers-University-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blan