ID=204168 Faculty School of Business, Education, and Humanities Academic / Faculty Exempt <b> Location: </b> Memphis, TN <B> Category: </B> Faculty <B> Job Type: </B> Exempt <B> Posted On: </B> Wed Aug 26 2026 <B> Job Description:</B> <BR><p><strong>Position Summary</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Dean of the McEniry School of Business, Education, and Humanities reports to the Vice President for Academic Affairs and is the academic officer charged with supervision overall departments and disciplines of the school, including overall responsibility for the curriculum and academic quality. As an academic officer, the Dean assumes a university-wide perspective and a strategic role in communication with the university's constituents including parents, perspective students, potential donors, industry, government, professional societies, an...<a href=\"http://cbu.interviewexchange.com/jobofferdetails.jsp?JOBID=204168\"> more...</a> Memphis, TN Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0400 Sat, 01 Jan 2050 23:59:59 -0500 JOBID=204168"
